# GPU timer recovery test
# Validates that the GPU profiler column survives a PROFILE_SCHEDULE_RESET.
#
# This scene was used to verify the fix for the GPU timer column disappearing
# after toggling the physics solver. The toggle was done manually (P key) and
# the profiler overlay was enabled via the debug menu.
seed 42
physics on
text on
frames 100
fixed_step
legacy_balls 5
screenshot_interval Profile/gpu_timer_test 10
pipeline_sync on
camera cam1 500 60 650  600 33 600  0 1 0
ball test_ball 600 33 600  12.0 50.0 10.0 0.8
